    "Desktop Spaces shows one space at a time, as the desktop's sidebar: switch spaces at the top, and each lists its windows by host, those on your other hosts too. By Host lists each host's sessions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「桌面空间」像桌面端侧边栏一样一次显示一个空间：在顶部切换空间，每个空间按主机列出它的窗口，包括位于其他主机上的窗口。「按主机」列出每个主机的会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
